---
// The support page's email link, shared by every locale. When the About
// window opens this page it appends ?v=<version>&os=<os>; the inline script
// folds them into the mailto subject, so a non-engineer's first email
// already carries the two facts support always needs — without making them
// find or type either one. Plain visits keep a plain subject, and the
// address stays visible as text either way: mailto is a silent dead end on
// machines with no mail client configured, so the copyable address is the
// real fallback.
---

<p>
  <strong
    ><a data-support-email href="mailto:sincekmori@gmail.com"
      >sincekmori@gmail.com</a
    ></strong
  >
</p>

<script src="../scripts/support-email.ts"></script>
